  "content": "\n\n<p>現在已上架 CurseForge！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>BiblioJacraft 是一款收納與整理模組，最初只設計了一個書架，如今已大幅擴展，提供更多精彩內容。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.bibliocraftmod.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.bibliocraftmod.com</a>&nbsp;查看所有內含方塊與物品的完整資訊。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://www.bibliocraftmod.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/SNuchazCorner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"592\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://www.bibliocraftmod.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/SAll.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"592\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://www.bibliocraftmod.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/atlas_gui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"535\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://www.bibliocraftmod.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/17showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"533\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://www.bibliocraftmod.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/biblio180showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"518\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://www.bibliocraftmod.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bigbook.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"532\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://www.bibliocraftmod.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/2013-02-05_00.37.33.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"592\"></p>",
